   "lines": [
    "Walked about fif-",
    "teen miles through",
    "the woods; about",
    "three miles were",
    "through a succession",
    "of alder swamps",
    "and cedar swamps,",
    "where the walking",
    "was about as",
    "difficult as any",
    "I have ever been",
    "through. I killed",
    "a spruce partridge",
    "in a cedar swamp",
    "and a birch part-",
    "ridge on a hemlock",
    "ridge."
   ],
